<div class="resources">
    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-09/index.html">Unit 9: Data &amp; Systems</a> — computer systems in the CED</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/reference/unity-csharp-quickref.html">Unity + C# Quick Reference</a> — Update vs FixedUpdate</li>
    </ul>
